and partial spellings. Related publishing, availability, distribution, and
freedom vocabulary gives smaller pulses; 'soon' gives a small negative one.
A following 'of', and the last character of split Chinese release compounds,
retain a release signal, as do completion particles and a publication-time
header separator. Remembered words reset at document boundaries. Most other
tokens predict zero; this ignores many weak responses.
