"""Approximate short English 'be/become/get + complement' constructions.

Locative, degree and relational complements give negative values. Pronouns and
some action participles give positive values. A weaker response lasts one more
token ('is not available', 'is located in'). Location and motion verbs also
trigger preposition/particle responses. Joined 'be'/'is' word fragments receive
separate positive responses, including mathematical/chemical 'iso-' stems.
Context-initial copula spellings have fixed baselines. This is a lexical
approximation, not a parser; reset all memory at document boundaries.
"""
READS = ()
BE = set('am is are was were be been being'.split())
PRONOUNS = set('i you he she it we they me him her us them'.split())
POSSESSIVES = set('my your his her its our their'.split())
BECOME = set('become becomes became becoming'.split())
CONTRACTIONS = {"'m": 0.55, "'re": 0.65, "'s": 0.25}
ISO_STEMS = ('isos', 'isom', 'isot', 'isov', 'isoc')
PREPOSITIONS = {
    'in': -2.25, 'at': -2.1, 'within': -2.35,
    'on': -1.55, 'between': -1.55, 'among': -1.7,
    'around': -1.65, 'inside': -1.7, 'like': -1.8,
    'of': -1.3, 'from': -1.3, 'under': -1.45, 'about': -1.35,
    'above': -1.25, 'below': -1.1, 'outside': -1.4,
    'behind': -1.5, 'beyond': -1.4, 'along': -1.4,
    'by': -1.1, 'with': -0.6, 'over': -0.7, 'through': -1.2, 'against': -1.0,
    'without': -1.1, 'across': -1.3, 'near': -1.1, 'via': -1.1,
    'up': -0.65, 'out': -0.6, 'down': -0.7, 'back': -0.7, 'here': -0.6,
}
DEGREE = {
    'more': -1.8, 'much': -1.4, 'too': -1.4,
    'less': -1.25, 'quite': -1.25, 'such': -1.25,
    'very': -0.85, 'so': -0.6, 'enough': -0.8,
    'just': -0.6, 'only': -0.45, 'even': -0.6, 'rather': -1.05,
